# Documentation

Document what exists. Use **IMPLEMENTED**, **SCAFFOLDED**, **PLANNED**, **PROVISIONAL**. Mark gaps `TODO`, `DECISION REQUIRED`, or **NOT DECIDED**.

Do not write fake OpenAPI, fake DDL, or fake dashboards.

When behavior or schema changes, update the matching file under `docs/` (architecture, API, database, security, testing).

Record approved tech choices in `docs/DECISIONS.md`. Do not silently promote provisional choices to confirmed.
